; Questeria, the capital, and the hub. The palace on its terrace to the north with the temple and
; the guildhall either side of it, the plaza and its fountain in the middle, houses to the west with
; the chapel in its garden above them, and the Lantern Market to the east: the Gilded Flagon, the
; stalls, and the bakery and the forge at its far end, with gardens and two houses past them. Then
; the canal, with a footbridge over to the washing yard, the avenue south to the city gate and the
; old road, and houses all along the south side. The Watch has a post by the gate and another where
; the harbour road comes in off the west side. Lit, and no fog: everyone knows the capital.

[map]
id = questeria
name = Questeria
world = 300 200
tileset = questeria
size = 108 58
dark = no
fog = no
music = Exploring

[legend]
# = plaza
= = terrace
: = cobble
, = grass
~ = water

